olor: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.9pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -54.5333px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 나. 신청기간(1차): <b>2024. 01. 02.(화) ~ 2024. 01. 19.(금)</b></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 40.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.9pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -54.5333px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; *&nbsp;학자금</span><span style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">융자 실행기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(1</span><span style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">차</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">):&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">2024. 02. 15.(목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">~</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">2024.&nbsp;04. 12.(</span><span style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 40.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 다. 지원자격&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 40.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; text-align: center; text-indent: -40.9pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 농어촌지역에 주민등록 주소를 두고 6개월(180일) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; text-align: center; text-indent: -40.9pt;\">이상 거주하거나 농어업에 종사하고 있는 학부모의 자녀(대학생) 또는 농어업에 종사하는 대학생 본인</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 40.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; text-align: center; text-indent: -40.9pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 농식품인재 대상학과(농업계대학 농림축산식품계열 학과)에 재학, 복학, 입학 예정인 대학생 본인</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 40.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 라. 성적 및 이수학점 기준 : 재학생 직전학기 최저이수학점 12학점 이상 이수 및 70점 이상(100점 만점) 성적 기준 통과자</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 40.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 마. 융자가능 금액 : 당해학기 등록금 전액</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 40.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 바. 융자이율 : 무이자</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 40.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 사. 신청절차: 한국장학재단 홈페이지에서 신청</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 40.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: -54.5333px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; *</span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: -54.5333px;\">&nbsp;시행주체: 한국장학재단 학자금대출부(1599-2000)</span><br></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 40.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 13pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 40.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">붙임&nbsp; 1. 2024-1학기 농총출신대학생 학자금융자 신청 안내문&nbsp;1부.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 40.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -1.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2. 2024-1학기 농촌출신대학생 학자금융자 홍보 포스터 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 40.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -40.9pt;\"></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
